	(text "+BATT	: Battery positive terminal, after protections\n+5V		: Boosted Battery output supply, always on when battery is alive\n+3V3	: Battery backed supply, always on when battery is alive\nVDD 	: Ethernet Subsystem Switched Power Supply derrived from +3V3\n+3.3V	: Switched peripheral power supply for radio, CAN. derrived from +3V3\nVCC		: CAN TRX Supply, switched from +5V\nVDDA	: Switched ethernet subsystem supply, derrived from +3V3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.136 24.892 0)
		(effects
